{
  "about": "Cases for bo-verify.ps1: block container reading and the features switch (ADR-0015). Every request is sent from the BDS console, which is the only source that may turn the feature on; the player-source checks (PERMISSION_DENIED for enable, reading while on, turning off) need `execute as` or chat and are in docs/TESTING.md OBS-CON-03..05. Needs a player online near 0 -60 0 in a flat overworld so the chunks along z = 8 are loaded. The run places containers at x = 3..18, z = 8, fills the double chest at x = 3..4 with long item ids (its answer is truncated, CON-05) and clears the row at the end. It starts by turning the feature off, so earlier state does not matter, and leaves it off.",
